Product Detail Android API test evidence
Command: ./gradlew :app:testDebugUnitTest :app:assembleDebug --no-daemon
Result: BUILD SUCCESSFUL
Test: PlatformApiProductDetailTest.productDetailBuildsAuthenticatedGetAndParsesAllFields

The test executes PlatformApi.productDetail("product-1") against OkHttp MockWebServer and verifies:
GET /api/platform/products/product-1 -> HTTP 200
Authorization: Bearer detail-token
x-tenant-id: tenant-detail
Parsed fields: id, business_id, sku, name, description, category, price_cents, currency, status, created_at, updated_at.
The Marketplace card opens the detail action, which invokes productDetail(product.id) and renders the returned fields in Compose.
